<title>UK: Seoulbank sets $100 mln three-year FRN.</title>
<headline>Seoulbank sets $100 mln three-year FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SEOULBANK</p>
<p> AMT    $100 MLN	BASE	 6M-LIBOR  MATURITY	.NOV.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +44.5 BP  PAY DATE    29.NOV.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY BAA2	ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   13.5 BP</p>
<p> LISTING    LONDON    DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK/KR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  KOREA</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
